    <h2>What we cannot do</h2>
    <p>
      We cannot recover a lost conversation, identify a user, read a message or
      close an account. Not as a matter of policy: there are no accounts, and the
      keys exist only on the devices. <a href="data-deletion.html">Data and
      deletion</a> sets out exactly what exists and where.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      Ideoa Labs. The source, the threat model and the technical report are all
      public, which is a better introduction than a page about us would be.
